text:
zoe: Quick sync for Meridian Health POC. Requirements: single websocket multiplexing many sessions, streaming tokens, tool/function calls in-stream, strict JSON schema for downstream ETL, EU data residency, customer-managed KMS + SSO. They want a tiny code sample, short runbook, legal blurb and a 1-week ballpark for 500 QPS. Need before tomorrow demo.

raj: We can do that. Use session_id per logical stream over one WS. For ordered tool calls and exactly-once semantics recommend Dedicated with sticky routing; hosted works for demo but may rebalance. Ephemeral creds supported (default 15m TTL).

megan: Minimal copy-paste Node example: 
```js
const WebSocket = require('ws');
const ws = new WebSocket(process.env.POC_WS_URL);
ws.on('open', () => ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'open', session_id: 'poc-1', schema_hints: { patient: { id: 'string', name: 'string' } } })));
ws.on('message', m => { const msg = JSON.parse(m); if (msg.type==='tool_call') { const res = { status: 'ok', result: { id: msg.args.id } }; ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type:'tool_response', session_id: msg.session_id, call_id: msg.call_id, result: JSON.stringify(res) })); } });
```
Curl handshake:
curl -X POST https://api.redwood.ai/handshake -H "Authorization: Bearer $RW_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"session_id":"poc-1","schema_hints":{"patient":{"id":"string"}}}'
// returns {"ws_url":"wss://...","expires_in":900}

raj: Note: tool handlers must be idempotent; if you need strict ordering use Dedicated + sticky sessions. Schema enforcement should be done in app; use our schema_hints to reduce parse failures.

megan: Legal blurb draft: "Runtime keeps KV cache and inference state in-memory for session duration. In Dedicated and Private deployments raw prompts/responses are not written to persistent storage by default. Customers may enable logging; exported logs follow agreed retention. Customer-managed KMS supported for at-rest encryption. Audit records for admin/provisioning available via the Console per contract."

raj: Ballpark for 500 QPS sustained (EU Dedicated test for 1 week): approx $22k-$42k depending on avg tokens per request and support level. Formal quote to follow.

